OL,5,G0300 Nobody's Fool
OL,6,     FThe pressure intensifies as the
OL,7,     Ffinal looms, with a quiz producing
OL,8,     Funexpected results and valuation
OL,9,     Fdescending into chaos as
OL,10,     Faccusations fly and the vote
OL,11,     Fcollapses into deadlock. When a
OL,12,     Frule is broken, Danny Dyer and
OL,13,     FEmily Atack are forced to
OL,14,     Fintervene, triggering a dramatic
OL,15,     Freversal and a shocking exit. A
OL,16,     Ffinal quiz redraws the leaderboard
OL,17,     Fbefore players are offered the
OL,18,     Fchance to leave immediately with
OL,19,     Ftheir winnings
