OL,9,G0500 Fern Britton: Inside the Vet's
OL,10,     FFern Britton returns to the Grove
OL,11,     FVets in Bristol for an insight
OL,12,     Finto the running of a busy
OL,13,     Fpractice at the heart of the local
OL,14,     Fcommunity. Pets brought in include
OL,15,     Fa Romanian rescue dog with a lump
OL,16,     Fin his mouth, a floppy-eared
OL,17,     FDoberman with a sore paw, and a
OL,18,     Fpair of lively cavalier King
OL,19,     FCharles spaniel sisters who are
OL,20,     Fdue to be spayed. Fern lends a
OL,21,     Fhand in the much-needed grooming
OL,22,     Fof a long-haired cat
